# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development. Never commit .dev.vars.
# .dev.vars supplies the TOKEN_SALT secret to `wrangler dev`, and is read by
# `npm run token` to compute project tokens. (The KV id / domain / prefix live in
# wrangler.jsonc, copied from wrangler.jsonc.example — not here.)

# Secret: HMAC key for deriving per-project access tokens. Use a long random value
# (e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`). Must match the value you set on the deployed Worker
# with `npx wrangler secret put TOKEN_SALT`.
TOKEN_SALT=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
